*Only the pools listed above contain Legend Rare Cats.
*Legend Rare Cats are considered separate from [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cats]], meaning that [[Guaranteed Uber Rare Cat Campaign]]s have no effect on the chances of getting one.

