==Trivia==
*Every non-collab Legend Rare has a part of them giving off a rainbow glow. As shown in the gallery above, non-collab Legend Rares also implode into a number of multicolored crystals when destroyed.
*Besides [[Gaia the Creator (Legend Rare Cat)|Gaia the Creator]], [[Lumina (Legend Rare Cat)|Lumina]] and the collab Legend Rares, all Legend Rare Cats' descriptions allude to other dimensions, worlds or realms in some way, though in the cases of [[Jeanne (Legend Rare Cat)|Jeanne]], [[Ushiwakamaru (Legend Rare Cat)|Ushiwakamaru]] and [[Emperor Cat (Legend Rare Cat)|Emperor Cat]] this only applies for their Japanese descriptions.
*No Legend Rare Cats had [[True Form]]s until [[Version 12.2 Update|12.2]], where [[High Lord Babel (Legend Rare Cat)|High Lord Babel]] became the first to receive one.

